  "subtitle": "Updated: Jun 17 2026",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "THA Iliopsoas Impingement is an under recognized cause of recurrent groin pain after total hip replacement which may be caused by a malpositioned acetabular component.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis may be suspected clinically with pain with resisted seated hip flexion or straight leg raise and the presence of anterior cup overhang on CT. Diagnostic cortisone injection into iliopsoas sheath is helpful in diagnosis.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is generally arthroscopic iliopsoas tenotomy in the setting of normal cup position. Revision of the acetabulum component may be indicated in cases of excessive anterior overhang.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "May be caused by",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "retained cement",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**malpositioned acetabular component**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "limb length discrepancy",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "excessive length of screws",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
